# Extension standards

## Role

Presentation only for policy: paint `state.json` / D-Bus payload. Do not re-implement billboard priority, digests, or ack rules in GJS.

```js
// Landing interrupt — entire routing rule
const billboard = this._state?.billboard;
if (billboard && billboard.id !== this._landingShownId) showLandingPage(billboard);
```

## Contracts

- Prefer **data not sentences** over the wire: `resetsSeconds`, `template: {id, params}`. English `text` remains for CLI / LLM rewrite.
- New user-visible strings: add keys to **all** catalogs in `locales.js` (en, fr, pt-BR) and a `templateText` case when adding a `tpl.*`.
- Locale override: prefer `TOKENS_GO_BRRR_LANG`; `AI_USAGE_LANG` remains a legacy alias.
- Keep `metadata.version` (integer) stable for GNOME hot-reload; bump `version-name` with semver via `scripts/bump_version.py`.
- D-Bus `IFACE_XML` must match `tokens_go_brrr/dbus_service.py`. Update both in the same change.

## Design system (popover)

- Square geometry, hairlines `#4b4b4e`, graphite `#2b2b2d`, snow `#f5f5f8`, steel `#94bce3`, Barlow (+ Condensed where used), ~380px width.
- Status: percentage beside colour; caution is hollow; respect `enable-animations`; never overshoot meter animation.
- Dark literals in CSS; light block via `python3 scripts/gen_light_css.py` after dark edits. JS colours live in `PALETTES`.
- Class prefix: `tokens-go-brrr-*` only.

## Devtest

Prefer `devtest/layout-smoke.sh` / mock daemon over ad-hoc Shell reloads when checking layout.
